orem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L151-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun_zero","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L148-L149","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun_mul","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L142-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun_one","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L139-L140","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.iotaFun","kind":"def","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L136-L137","doc":"The inclusion on carriers: `a·γ + b·σ₀ ↦ (a, b, 0, 0, 0, 0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.markovTrace_H2A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.markovTrace_H2A","kind":"instance","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L128-L134","doc":"**The n = 2 `MarkovTrace` instance** — with `markovTrace_H3A`, both\nconcrete rungs of the tower now inhabit the class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.trace₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.trace₂","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L125-L126","doc":"The n = 2 Markov trace: `trace₂(a·γ + b·σ₀) = a + z·b` (weights (1, z)). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.instAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.instAlgebra","kind":"instance","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L119-L123","doc":"**H₂(q) is an R-algebra.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.instCommRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.instCommRing","kind":"instance","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L104-L117","doc":"**H₂(q) is a commutative ring** — the rank-one Hecke product laws all\nclose by `ring` on coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.one_b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.one_b","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH2AlgebraInstance.lean#L102-L102","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.one_a","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H2A.one_a","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-u